    "heading": "Level 14: Peerless Skill",
    "lineStart": 2600,
    "lineEnd": 2602
  },
  "section": "3.54",
  "rulesText": "When you make an ability check or attack roll and fail, you can expend one use of Bardic Inspiration; roll the Bardic Inspiration die, and add the number rolled to the d20, potentially turning a failure into a success. On a failure, the Bardic Inspiration isn't expended."
}
